{"id":5162,"date":"2025-08-21T06:30:31","date_gmt":"2025-08-21T06:30:31","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.swat4ls.org\/?page_id=5162"},"modified":"2026-01-26T16:03:53","modified_gmt":"2026-01-26T16:03:53","slug":"amsterdam2026","status":"publish","type":"page","link":"https:\/\/www.swat4ls.org\/workshops\/amsterdam2026\/","title":{"rendered":"Amsterdam 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>March 23 &#8211; 26<\/strong><\/p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Welcome to SWAT4HCLS 2026: Bridging Life Sciences and Technology<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">We are thrilled to announce that after a decade, SWAT4HCLS is returning to Amsterdam! We are excited to welcome you all to the AmsterdamUMC for what promises to be an inspiring and productive event.<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Stay tuned for updates on this page and our social media channels. We encourage you to follow us and engage with our community. If you have suggestions for improvements, would like to (co-)organize a side event, or want to support the event through sponsorship and\/or other means, please don&#8217;t hesitate to reach out. Your input and support are invaluable to us.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">As in previous editions, we will have a day dedicated to tutorials and a biohackathon. We welcome suggestions and proposals for both.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">We will soon announce the set of submission deadlines, so keep an eye out for those details.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">We look forward to seeing you in Amsterdam!<\/p>\n\n\n\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity\"\/>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Location<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">SWAT4HCLS will be taking place at the following address:<br>Amsterdam UMC<br><em>AMC location<\/em><br>Meibergdreef 9<br>1105 AZ Amsterdam<br>the Netherlands<\/p>\n\n\n\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity\"\/>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Getting there<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">AmsterdamUMC is accessible through the Amsterdam Holendrecht <a href=\"https:\/\/www.ns.nl\/en\/station-information\/ashd\/amsterdam-holendrecht\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">train <\/a>and <a href=\"https:\/\/www.gvb.nl\/en\/travel-information\/stop\/NL:Q:30009527\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">metro<\/a> station.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity\"\/>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Nearby hotels<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Amsterdam UMC is located on the outskirts of Amsterdam and is well connected to both Amsterdam Schiphol Airport and the city centre via frequent public transport services. Accommodation in or near the city centre is suitable.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Several hotels are located within walking distance or one metro stop from Amsterdam UMC, including:<\/p>\n\n\n\n<ol start=\"1\" class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Hotel Levell<\/strong>, Hullenbergweg 353, 1101 CR Amsterdam, The Netherlands<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Joy Hotel<\/strong>, Hullenbergweg 385, 1101 CS Amsterdam, The Netherlands<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Fletcher Hotel<\/strong>, Schepenbergweg 50, 1105 AT Amsterdam, The Netherlands<\/li>\n<\/ol>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"> <\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><\/p>\n\n\n\n<!-- START SOCIAL MEDIA WIDGET --><ul id=\"servicesbar\">\n<li id=\"mastodon\" style=\"padding-right:10px !important;\"><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https:\/\/genomic.social\/@swat4hcls\" rel=\"noopener\"><IMG src=\"https:\/\/www.swat4ls.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/12\/screen-icon-swat4ls-mastodon@2x.png\" alt=\"SWAT4HCLS on Mastodon\"><\/a><\/li>\n<li id=\"bluesky\" style=\"padding-right:10px !important;\"><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https:\/\/bsky.app\/profile\/swat4hcls.bsky.social\" rel=\"n